              "- Pupils look at Picture 1 and guess what is in the picture.\n\n\n- Pupils read the two sentences underneath Picture 1.\n\n- Pupils complete the activity.\n\n- Pupils check answers and repeat the sentences.\n\n\n\n- Pupils follow the teacher’s instructions."
